WEBVTT

00:30:26.996 --> 00:30:30.663
demonstrate how how how gigantic
that loss was.

00:30:31.246 --> 00:30:33.663
And what I realized is the
only way I could do that,

00:30:33.663 --> 00:30:37.454
the absolute only way I could do that
was to make good on my intentions,

00:30:37.454 --> 00:30:41.371
to make good on my ambitions, to be the
woman my mother raised me to be,

00:30:41.371 --> 00:30:46.121
as I said, and wild to become, to become.

00:30:47.163 --> 00:30:51.329
It's interesting you brought her to life
through your words and, you know,

00:30:51.329 --> 00:30:53.246
she brought you to life through her life.

00:30:53.996 --> 00:30:58.288
It's a really nice symmetry there,
it's crazy, you know, I lost her,

00:30:59.246 --> 00:31:03.704
I was the same age when she died as she
was when she was pregnant with me.